{"id":"2687808","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:5e6ffe9a-235a-49ed-8a34-84aedba2db5c:page/2687808","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6NWU2ZmZlOWEtMjM1YS00OWVkLThhMzQtODRhZWRiYTJkYjVjOmNvbnRlbnQvMjY4NzgwOA==","status":"current","title":"Betting On Italian Exchange","version":{"by":{"type":"known","accountId":"712020:f5489746-e400-4327-98bc-26e96c9f4e77","accountType":"atlassian","email":"","publicName":"Neil Thomas","profilePicture":{"path":"/wiki/aa-avatar/712020:f5489746-e400-4327-98bc-26e96c9f4e77","width":48,"height":48,"isDefault":false},"displayName":"Neil Thomas","isExternalCollaborator":false,"isGuest":false,"locale":"en_US","accountStatus":"active","_expandable":{"operations":"","personalSpace":""},"_links":{"self":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/user?accountId=712020:f5489746-e400-4327-98bc-26e96c9f4e77"}},"when":"2026-07-31T09:37:01.018Z","friendlyWhen":"Jul 31, 2026","message":"","number":39,"minorEdit":false,"ncsStepVersion":"101","ncsStepVersionSource":"ncs-ack","confRev":"confluence$content$2687808.725","contentTypeModified":false,"_expandable":{"collaborators":"","content":"/rest/api/content/2687808"},"_links":{"self":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2687808/version/39"}},"macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"storage":{"value":"<p local-id=\"f971dcee142a\" /><p local-id=\"bf3bae5950a3\" /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc-zone\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"58c44ad8-47dc-4033-b8ae-46c78ffd4ad0\" ac:macro-id=\"abbfe08c398f775500214abe9eb0e8977f2e31a85aa8a046721479d4f347c60a\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"minLevel\">1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"maxLevel\">2</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"type\">flat</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"separator\">pipe</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><h2 local-id=\"ffe714b3ba12\">How to Access the Italian Exchange API</h2><p local-id=\"44dba4042792\">Italian residents who have registered an Italian Exchange account can access the Betfair Exchange API. Italian residents can register an account via&nbsp;<a href=\"https://register.betfair.it/account/registration\"><strong>https://register.betfair.it/account/registration</strong></a></p><p local-id=\"25f53a5cfc79\">To use the Italian Exchange API you need to <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Application Keys\" ri:version-at-save=\"143\" /><ac:link-body><strong>Create an Application Key</strong></ac:link-body></ac:link> for your Italian Exchange account.</p><p local-id=\"ac8e2fc1c446\">Once you have done created an App Key, you will need to login to the Exchange API using the appropriate Italian Exchange endpoint which are as follows:</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"cd6dba85-7fa2-4114-ae0a-b2843c8f3b83\" ac:macro-id=\"bf4176a1-f930-49ab-91be-df9b9f2b74fc\"><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id=\"0fc12e00501c\">Please see full technical details relating to the above API Login endpoints via <ac:link ac:local-id=\"035fe5fa-13b2-4dc6-8324-6224a4956e2d\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Login &amp; Session Management\" ri:version-at-save=\"81\" /><ac:link-body>Login &amp; Session Management</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"e18c17f77c0b\">Non-interactive Login</h2><p local-id=\"3c91fdf093e5\">For fully automated applications</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"8e43e173de88\" ac:macro-id=\"f3cb7ff5-3620-42a3-ba0f-48ca9dd3ac74\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[https://identitysso-cert.betfair.it/api/certlogin]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"8f07d75f320c\">Interactive Login - Desktop Application</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"ae95e16a068e\" ac:macro-id=\"148198f7-bced-4856-ad86-1e75363e797f\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[https://identitysso.betfair.it/view/login?product=<AppKey>&url=https://www.betfair.it]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"3deb79dbfa80\">API Login - Desktop Application</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"246b66153fbd\" ac:macro-id=\"d930374c-7cbd-44ae-a0a2-49844c16de09\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[https://identitysso.betfair.it/api/login]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p local-id=\"0bc9f404e465\">Once a session token has been obtained via the .it login methods above, any further API requests should be sent to the Exchange endpoints indicated below. &nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"a9e7fe35057f\" ac:macro-id=\"2bfc2e9b-723c-4edc-8b00-c4de552dca14\"><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id=\"9ad1ec01348a\">Requests to these endpoints will automatically return the markets that are available to Italian Exchange customers via the <a href=\"http://Betfair.it\">Betfair.it</a> domain.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"b20b90212a14\">Betting API Endpoints</h2><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"fadeb3a0-1f2d-4724-a1f7-6111a510daee\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"6c8e85e3be88\"><th ac:local-id=\"886cb4878dcc\"><p local-id=\"507b3d6173df\"><strong>Interface</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"86d90074f606\"><p local-id=\"403fb14b1ed6\"><strong>Endpoint</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"640bae942851\"><p local-id=\"2f1b89ae2979\"><strong>JSON-RPC Prefix</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"6b59945f763a\"><p local-id=\"fa36d147c832\"><strong>&lt;methodname&gt; Example</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"3092a1f0b79e\"><td ac:local-id=\"78d2e89a46ff\"><p local-id=\"0184229702fa\">JSON-RPC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"36f539540825\"><p local-id=\"8df811577911\"><a href=\"https://api.betfair.com/exchange/betting/json-rpc/v1\">https://api.betfair.com/exchange/betting/json-rpc/v1</a></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"2ea22300e05a\"><p local-id=\"fc9b8f977038\">&lt;methodname&gt;</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8d099bac5919\"><p local-id=\"c154457f077e\">SportsAPING/v1.0/listMarketBook</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"5eff2ce8748a\"><td ac:local-id=\"7069910f62aa\"><p local-id=\"42f68fdba640\">JSON REST</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5631d6e876ee\"><p local-id=\"d7b5bf492297\"><a href=\"https://api.betfair.com/exchange/betting/rest/v1.0\">https://api.betfair.com/exchange/betting/rest/v1.0</a>/</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a36fc9dfb43f\"><p local-id=\"fe137b6841cd\">&nbsp;</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1c7b6c47d2aa\"><p local-id=\"60238cb8b493\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 local-id=\"bb7097b1dce8\">Accounts API Endpoints</h2><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"1c5de5e2-a3a2-4608-9d71-fefc5faac7e2\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"a09c2c8a9a9b\"><th ac:local-id=\"363d5d8a59bf\"><p local-id=\"a48cf9b5be43\"><strong>Interface</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"049f49cf8863\"><p local-id=\"260899c5f2de\"><strong>Endpoint</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"97a13b1ecbda\"><p local-id=\"d8b3e7302d3c\"><strong>JSON-RPC Prefix</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"1f2d84b703db\"><p local-id=\"74afbab39dd0\"><strong>&lt;methodname&gt; Example</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"141084a91b9b\"><td ac:local-id=\"8119bbe9b900\"><p local-id=\"a5ff9d5891c3\">JSON-RPC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3977085152d8\"><p local-id=\"a5610d0f5a1b\"><a href=\"https://api.betfair.com/exchange/account/json-rpc/v1\">https://api.betfair.com/exchange/account/json-rpc/v1</a></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"27553b2570cb\"><p local-id=\"a9db60c7384e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&lt;methodname&gt;</span></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8b86819475d1\"><p local-id=\"f8b847d3e705\">&nbsp;AccountAPING/v1.0/getAccountFunds</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"ecb3aac224df\"><td ac:local-id=\"4e73db885770\"><p local-id=\"b3a21aaba5bd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">JSON REST</span></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e2da54355e00\"><p local-id=\"c0d89199edd4\"><a href=\"https://api.betfair.com/exchange/account/rest/v1.0\">https://api.betfair.com/exchange/account/rest/v1.0</a></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1c3a3838cafe\"><p local-id=\"8f422e0088b0\">&nbsp;</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"710f59c0df1b\"><p local-id=\"d13cf74cbfbd\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 local-id=\"63cbabca8423\">Exchange Stream API</h2><p local-id=\"8a95b667ebca\">The Exchange Stream is available to Betfair Italy customers. Please see documentation via <ac:link ac:local-id=\"13a02f8bec54\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Exchange Stream API\" ri:version-at-save=\"185\" /><ac:link-body>Exchange Stream API</ac:link-body></ac:link> and Stream API endpoint details below:</p><h3 local-id=\"dc80c3de2233\">TCP / SSL Connection</h3><p local-id=\"b8f0f9e53354\">Connection is established with an SSL socket to the following address:</p><h5 local-id=\"685aac4dd690\"><strong>External (SSL):</strong></h5><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"bb262a7670c8\" ac:macro-id=\"b48c3ed9-a4f0-4fce-a642-47ab4525c0fd\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[stream-api.betfair.com:443]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"e90b8ca1f39a\">How do I Activate My Live Application Key</h2><p local-id=\"2785ca193fc6\">To apply to activate your&nbsp;<strong>Live Application key</strong>&nbsp;for betting use, please&nbsp;click&nbsp;<a href=\"https://developer.betfair.com/get-started/\"><strong>here</strong></a>&nbsp;and select&nbsp;<strong>Exchange API &gt; For My Personal Betting</strong>&nbsp;and complete the application form at the bottom of the page.</p><p local-id=\"e05531c8af1b\"><strong>Before applying, you should:</strong></p><ul local-id=\"5b66631c-e437-44c9-847f-5d74d1599319\"><li local-id=\"595418c1-9566-41a4-b9de-b340bc4d9d79\"><p local-id=\"18d153947461\">Complete&nbsp;any testing using your Delayed Application key (<strong>Please note:</strong> <a href=\"https://support.developer.betfair.com/hc/en-us/articles/25033076334748-What-is-read-only-Betfair-API-access\">read-only </a>access using the Live App Key isn't permitted)</p></li><li local-id=\"f0f3f8db-e54d-41bb-bb65-cd94ac3ff052\"><p local-id=\"accc1a739d82\">Ensure that your account has been fully verified in line with our<a href=\"https://support.betfair.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/71/\"> KYC policy</a>.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"5072ecbac32e\" ac:macro-id=\"82e255c7-8310-4c7c-a244-08d454eb564d\"><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id=\"cb3d5cbf1e21\"><strong>Please Note:</strong> There is no Live App Key activation fee applied to Betfair Italy Exchange accounts.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2 local-id=\"fc6c82069b7b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Italian Exchange Specific Bet Rules</span></h2><p local-id=\"4bbfd2869387\">There are several additional regulatory rules which apply specifically and only to accounts betting on the Italian Exchange (<a href=\"https://www.betfair.it/exchange):\">https://www.betfair.it/exchange):</a></p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"e9c7ba1a29f2\"><li local-id=\"c64adb36f11d\"><p local-id=\"30ab046c54da\">The stake for each back offer is a minimum of 200 Euro Cents and can only be incremented in multiples of 50 Euro Cents.</p></li><li local-id=\"14473e733f8e\"><p local-id=\"b73407c27aa5\">Any lay offers placed by the customer, must be placed in such a way as to ensure that the stake for any corresponding back offer amounts to a minimum of 50 Euro Cents.</p></li><li local-id=\"c7495211773f\"><p local-id=\"00476ab0cf89\">A placeOrders request may contain up to 50 bet instructions. &nbsp;Any submissions containing more than 50 instructions will fail.</p></li><li local-id=\"48fedcf8468d\"><p local-id=\"16068e981923\">We cannot accept betting offers with potential winnings, calculated on the basis of the pre-selected odds that exceed the amount envisaged by article 12, paragraph 4, of Finance Minister Decree no. 111 of 1 March 2006 (10,000 Euros).<strong> N.B. This amount includes the original stake.</strong></p></li><li local-id=\"85b6dca752aa\"><p local-id=\"64da7fbca8be\">placeOrders request containing both back and lay bets in the same order will be rejected.&nbsp;</p></li></ol></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p local-id=\"7cd326a29157\" /><p local-id=\"95c7461542a6\"><br /></p>","representation":"storage","embeddedContent":[],"_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/2687808"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":1},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/2687808/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/2687808/history","descendants":"/rest/api/content/2687808/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/2687808/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=2687808","webui":"/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687808/Betting+On+Italian+Exchange","edituiv2":"/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/edit-v2/2687808","context":"/wiki","self":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2687808","tinyui":"/x/QAMp","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki"}}